  <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
    <details key="documentation" value="The part of the Analysis Services 2010 engine namespace that the exception namespace reaches into: where a warning happened. Only that part - the engine namespaces describe the whole DDL surface, which is a separate model and a separate task. This exists because an Error's Location names the column or the measure it is about, and typing that as a string loses which."/>
